WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Purchase-feedback SMS permission is separate for this store and channel. Permission alone does not send an invitation.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Withdraw only purchase-feedback SMS. Other message choices remain independent.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Read the recorded invitation. Its original message language may differ from the current interface.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Mark the invitation as read. This saved inbox state does not prove external SMS delivery.
